    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 11:51:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年，我们三个先后经历了乔迁和入宅，风水师说了，家居场域会影响财运，所以这一期如果你刚搬新家，正发愁在清洗、收纳、舒适、美观等方面家具家电选配和家居排布，可以听听我们三个的摁头安利，本期无广（毕竟订阅量还很少hhhh）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>下文也分享我们三个不同风格的</span><strong><span>家居照片</span></strong><span>嘻嘻，欢迎大家一起在评论区讨论各种买买买心得~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 曾经对拖地机嗤之以鼻，现在爱不释手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 除螨仪就是智商税，绝对、一定以及肯定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 除湿机的完美闭环：集天地精华用来冲厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a> 当P人学会货架思路，搬家专业户从此躺平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 当高敏的人遇上风水师，收纳难题有解了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 投影仪哪有电视香？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> i人的世界里怎么能少得了一张单人沙发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 解救打工人：床垫、升降桌、揉肚仪、筋膜枪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 这些提升幸福感的颜值家居，你也要拥有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a> 本期消费开窍：用10年后的眼光审视当下消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2991">49:51</a> 避坑：宜家木质家居给南方人带来的潮湿恐惧</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>大林的家</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrHd4wNXNRLKzGBD-HBHMb2xYXUJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>小樽的家</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2eQ33_U4fiXbbv3uJ-d-baGZSN.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>陶瓷的家</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq7zOzHHcn-IrhrNu_kKjtjouMug.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果你认可我们的节目，记得一键三连，订阅、分享、评论，让我们的声音被更多小伙伴听见~感恩感恩！💖</span></p><span><